# Golden decode-regression vectors (Task 8, decision 9c) ARE committed --
# small, frozen reference WAVs read by crates/coppa-protocol/tests/golden_vectors.rs.
!testdata/golden/*.wav
# COP-115 independent Direwolf interoperability recordings.
!testdata/il2p/*.wav
# COP-116 pinned synthetic Direwolf acceptance recording.
!testdata/g3ruh/g3ruh_9600_100frames_10db.wav

